# The step-cap and window sweep, its screen: one run of each candidate in the discriminating scenario on W5's first
# sample of the agents (seed 11, the development sample), each call opening with a warm-up turn. The change (make-room
# as the PRs propose it, no reserve) at step caps of 256, 512 and 1,024 and windows of 48 and 96 tokens, and behind the
# gateway's static cap of 8 and 4 background requests in flight; tuned vLLM at a step cap of 1,024 and the frozen box
# behind the same static caps; the change's 48-token configuration at 512/256 (W5's) and voice alone as the round's
# controls. The candidates that pass go on to sweep-r1.campaign to sweep-r5.campaign, on fresh samples.
#   benchmarks/e2/campaign.sh --pause benchmarks/e2/sweep-screen.campaign

agents-seed 11

# engine frozen
arms/w5-a1-voice.toml
arms/sweep-disc-frozen-cap8-s24.toml
arms/sweep-disc-frozen-cap4-s24.toml

# engine frozen --max-num-batched-tokens 1024 --long-prefill-token-threshold 0
arms/sweep-disc-b1024-t0-s24.toml

# engine make-room --additional-config.make_room.reserve_tokens 0 --additional-config.make_room.budget_cap_tokens 48
arms/w5-disc-pr-ab48-s24.toml
arms/sweep-disc-pr-ab48-cap8-s24.toml
arms/sweep-disc-pr-ab48-cap4-s24.toml

# engine make-room (48-token window) --max-num-batched-tokens 1024 --long-prefill-token-threshold 0
arms/sweep-disc-pr-ab48-b1024-t0-s24.toml

# engine make-room (48-token window) --max-num-batched-tokens 1024 --long-prefill-token-threshold 256
arms/sweep-disc-pr-ab48-b1024-t256-s24.toml

# engine make-room (96-token window) --max-num-batched-tokens 1024 --long-prefill-token-threshold 0
arms/sweep-disc-pr-ab96-b1024-t0-s24.toml

# engine make-room (48-token window) --max-num-batched-tokens 256 --long-prefill-token-threshold 0
arms/sweep-disc-pr-ab48-b256-t0-s24.toml
